  "adoption": {
    "maxInlineSvgSites": 47,
    "note": "Ratchet for components that still hand-author <svg> artwork. The gate fails the moment the number of sites grows, so new drift is impossible while the backlog is paid down at leisure. Sites excused as genuinely non-iconographic artwork are excluded from this ceiling, so the number always means \"artwork somebody could still migrate\"; each escape is carried by a marker with a mandatory reason and is reported in the ledger. The per-file breakdown is deliberately NOT stored here — it is derived live, because a hand-maintained copy of it is a second source of truth that nothing verifies and that therefore rots."
  }
